s Stormænd samles med Folket, der tilhører Abrahams Gud; thi Guds er Jordens Skjolde, højt ophøjet er han!"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/dan_det/PSA/47.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/dan_det/PSA/48.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/dan_det/PSA/46.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}